title: cryo_vault_start
tags: ice_giant
---
Buried in the ice ring is a vault marked with the symbol of the 'First Ark'—a mission launched 500 years ago that was presumed lost. The airlock is frozen shut. #line:cryo_vault_start_00
-> Melt Seal <<if has_item("resource_fuel", 3)>> #line:cryo_vault_start_01
    <<take_item resource_fuel 3>>
    <<jump cryo_vault_vault_enter>>
-> Use Explosives #line:cryo_vault_start_02
    <<jump cryo_vault_vault_damaged>>
===

title: cryo_vault_vault_enter
tags: 
---
Inside are thousands of genetic samples—embryos of Earth's extinct animals. A custodian AI wakes up. 'Are you the Gardeners? Is it safe to plant yet?' #line:cryo_vault_vault_enter_00
-> Lie\: 'Yes, it is safe.' #line:cryo_vault_vault_enter_01
    <<give_item item_seed_bank 1>>
    <<stop>>
-> Truth\: 'No, the galaxy is dying.' #line:cryo_vault_vault_enter_02
    <<give_item item_genetic_stimulants 1>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: cryo_vault_vault_damaged
tags: 
---
The explosion compromises some of the samples, but you gain access. Inside are genetic samples and a custodian AI that powers down from the shock. #line:cryo_vault_vault_damaged_00
-> Salvage What You Can #line:cryo_vault_vault_damaged_01
    <<give_item item_genetic_stimulants 1>>
    <<damage_ship 5>>
    <<stop>>
===

